<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on consumer stocks basket.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on consumer stocks basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it proposed to issue 100 million American style call warrants on a basket of five consumer sector stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket is comprised of:</p>
<p> Giordano International Ltd		 0.5 shares</p>
<p> Goldlion Holdings Ltd			1.0 shares</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd		    0.5 shares</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd			     1.0 shares</p>
<p> Tingyi (Cayman Islands) Holdings Corp  2.0 shares</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.668    PREMIUM	 9.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6209    GEARING	 3.36x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  14.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 28.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  40,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$20.835</p>
<p>NOTE: GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
